&lt;li&gt;turbopack: use reverse postorder priority in compute_chunk_group_info: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5938303552&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100428&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100428/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100428&quot;&gt;#100428&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turbopack: propagate late partial namespace provenance to passthrough targets: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5942006338&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100444&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100444/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100444&quot;&gt;#100444&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;turbopack: store unused reference edges in a keyed Vc: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5940575197&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100441&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100441/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100441&quot;&gt;#100441&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AGENTS.md: prefer e2e/execution tests over implementation-mapped unit tests: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5942564723&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100451&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100451/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100451&quot;&gt;#100451&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: document useRouter push/replace void return and useTransition migration: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5931722231&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100420&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100420/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100420&quot;&gt;#100420&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;docs: type proxy examples with NextRequest and fix cookie check: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5931122053&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100417&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100417/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100417&quot;&gt;#100417&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turbopack: keep env and preview props invalidations key-granular on warm start: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5934297322&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100425&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100425/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100425&quot;&gt;#100425&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;test: unflake prefetch-fallback-static in deploy: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5616744849&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/99366&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/99366/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/99366&quot;&gt;#99366&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Activity testing guide claim about label and placeholder locators: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5942009147&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100445&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100445/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100445&quot;&gt;#100445&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[ci] Upload adapter test results via GitHub Actions OIDC: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5926887213&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/100400&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vercel/next.js/pull/100400/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/pull/100400&quot;&gt;#100400&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
